# Word templates put in this folder (your organisation's .dotx/.docx, or one made with
# make_word_template.bat) stay on this computer: they are not committed to git, because a
# template can carry logos, classification markings, author names and server paths.
# If your repository is internal and should keep the template, delete these lines.
*.docx
*.dotx
*.docm
*.dotm
*.doc
*.dot
